{"id":1060101,"name":"ハーメル・取り調べⅠ","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"ハーメル・取り調べⅠ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1060101]}],"trial":{"trial_id":60101,"stage":"段階1","unlock_time":"2022-11-24 14:00:00","diary1":"最終的にFACは、BR-001ブラックリングの遺跡の汚染を処理し、幻境から目覚めたハーメルをMBCCに連れ戻した。\n　この汚染処理作戦を担当したメンバーによると、カーニバルから離れたハーメルの精神状態は不安定だったという。流れる時間も23年後のディスシティも、彼女にとって全てが奇妙なものだった。","diary2":"ハーメルがカーニバルに残る理由はノーマンではない。彼女は何にとらわれているのだろうか？\n　この問いの答えを、ハーメル自身も覚えていない。\n　今のハーメルの極めて脆い状態と、具現化されながらもとらえどころのない負の感情によって、あなたは取り調べを一旦中止しなければならなかった。","evidence":[{"ID":260263,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260264,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":3,"dialogue_id":160101010,"next":[11]},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":1,"dialogue_id":160101016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":3,"dialogue_id":160101021,"next":[22]},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160101022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dia